{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"<@246711433730064384>\n\nOnce you start your long rest, a round of draining nightmares come\n\nYou enter your bedroom, exhausted after a long day. As you close the door, the doorway disappears, along with your furniture, leaving you in an empty, windowless, doorless room. Well, not completely empty. Leaning against the wall are Heaven’s Call, The Belt of Dwarvenkind, and Cinnamon. They begin to sing songs that cause you to cringe in another life. As they finish a little ditty called “Call Me Maybe,” they begin to sing... a rick roll? You cover your ears to block out the cursed music but- breaking through the wall, a blue Yeti arm shatters the 4th wall. Daysong comes in and rips you out of the nightmare. He hands you Dinosaur Broccoli Nuggets and reads you a soft poem about bees. His last gift to you.\n\nYou were cursed, but were saved. You will feel fully rested in the morning.","created_at":"2020-08-07T08:45:51.673000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-07T08:46:14.351000Z","id":"741215522460270593","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
