{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"When she opens them again she looks at Rigatony \"Time here doesn't make sense.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:21:34.801000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742311674987413656","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"\"Not much makes sense here\" he smiles, looking over at her","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:21:59.524000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742311778683191356","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"The moment Heaven's call starts singing he throws the blade in an arc behind him, landing it on a cushioned footstool next to Cinnamon","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:22:41.578000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-10T09:22:51.187000Z","id":"742311955070713938","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"\"I left for this place a day before you. I should have arrived here a day before you, yet I spent over a year on this island alone.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:23:24.024000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742312133101879417","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"\"And now I'm sitting here wondering if I missed out on something because time is keeping me stranded here. Or if for some reason the Gods just wanted to play with me. Leave me abandoned for too long... \" shs trails off. \"It's a lot to think about I suppose.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:25:39.039000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742312699395965019","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"\"Thinking is a dangerous pastime Lady Lilia, eating croissants is much more enjoyable\" he pushes the plate closer to her and snags one for himself","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:26:37.270000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742312943634612234","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"\"I would never say we are here for a reason, that we are guided by any one god to our fates. It is simply because of your will to survive that you are here with us, and by our combined strength we continue to live\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:27:31.898000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-10T09:27:49.229000Z","id":"742313172761051138","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"\"Live, and enjoy these buttery pieces of bread\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:28:02.566000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742313301391704185","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"He takes a bite and a sip of wine","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:28:14.231000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742313350318391347","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"Lilia laughs to herself. \"Part of why I survived was my devotion to the Raven Queen. You should understand that devotion being a knight.\" She takes a croissant.","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:31:21.711000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742314136666636359","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"He laughs \"If I were to pray to that which gave me power, then old karaoke night back there would sing thrice as loudly as his ego\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:32:23.709000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742314396704964618","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"\"But I see where you are coming from.\" he takes another bite","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:33:34.733000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742314694601343006","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"\"You have a much more relaxed way of life. I could see why worshiping a God or God's does not interest you.\" She looks around at the fine wine and comfy furniture.","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:35:23.913000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742315152535453728","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"He smiles \"I enjoy it while I can.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:36:20.945000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742315391744999449","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"\"I have spent too many years alone, stranded, imprisoned, or sat in court not to take a bit of life for myself\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:36:55.663000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742315537362845736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"\"Get back to me after you have survived off of goblin for a year\" he laughs heartily and sips the wine","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:37:44.283000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-10T09:37:55.719000Z","id":"742315741289644102","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"\"I mean no disrespect to the dead of course.\" he says hastily","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:38:13.598000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742315864245665792","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"How deep the Father’s love for us,\nHow vast beyond all measure,\nThat He should give His only Son\nTo make a wretch His treasure.\nHow great the pain of searing loss –\nThe Father turns His face away,\nAs wounds which mar the Chosen One\nBring many sons to glory.\n\nBehold the man upon a cross,\nMy sin upon His shoulders;\nAshamed, I hear my mocking voice\nCall out among the scoffers.\nIt was my sin that held Him there\nUntil it was accomplished;\nHis dying breath has brought me life –\nI know that it is finished.\n\nI will not boast in anything,\nNo gifts, no power, no wisdom;\nBut I will boast in Jesus Christ,\nHis death and resurrection.\nWhy should I gain from His reward?\nI cannot give an answer;\nBut this I know with all my heart –\nHis wounds have paid my ransom.","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:40:06.516000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742316337858084975","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"\"I've survived on this island alone for over a year after the ship I was on wrecked. I was the lone survivor. I think I can understand the thought of struggling to survive.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:40:16.437000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742316379470037015","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
